+# *** Svinval Standard Extension ***
+sinval_vma        0001011 ..... ..... 000 00000 1110011 @sfence_vma
+sfence_w_inval    0001100 00000 00000 000 00000 1110011
+sfence_inval_ir   0001100 00001 00000 000 00000 1110011
